/-- Profiles of the points `0` (the minimal coupling) and `1` (the update of site 0). -/
noncomputable def sD : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ := ![![1 / 4, 1], ![1 / 2, 1]]

/-- Every site is updated to the point 1 (only site 0 is outside `S`). -/
