    (∀ i j, 0 ≤ sC i j) ∧ (∀ i, sC i i = 0) ∧ (∀ i, 0 ≤ sW i) ∧
    (∀ i, 0 ≤ sD 0 i) ∧ (∀ i ∈ sS, sD 0 i ≤ 1) ∧
    (∀ i ∉ sS, cost sW sD 0 < cost sW sD (sUpd i)) ∧
